1
00:00:03,870 --> 00:00:05,010
好极了
Oh, good job.

2
00:00:05,010 --> 00:00:07,160
今天真是个好天气
Oh, yes, such a beautiful day.

3
00:00:07,160 --> 00:00:08,540
我们找一个阳光猛烈的地方吃早午餐吧
Let's go have brunch somewhere outside

4
00:00:08,540 --> 00:00:10,100
好让我显摆一下我的新眼镜
Where I can wear my new sunglasses, huh?

5
00:00:10,100 --> 00:00:11,640
天啊 你怎么了
Ew, gross! What happened to you?

6
00:00:11,640 --> 00:00:12,720
我身体不适
I don't feel good.

7
00:00:13,040 --> 00:00:14,140
我忽热
I'm hot.

8
00:00:15,175 --> 00:00:16,160
忽冷
Now I'm cold.

9
00:00:16,160 --> 00:00:17,140
不会吧
Oh, no.

10
00:00:17,367 --> 00:00:19,760
可我们今晚还要去看演唱会
and we have that concert tonight.

11
00:00:19,760 --> 00:00:21,000
我知道 亲爱的
I know, but, honey,

12
00:00:21,120 --> 00:00:23,320
现在先别担心这个 身体要紧
That's the furthest thing from my mind, okay?

13
00:00:23,480 --> 00:00:24,260
为什么是我
Why me?!

14
00:00:24,540 --> 00:00:26,540
我们买了女神卡卡演唱会里最棒的位置
We had amazing seats for Lady GAGA,

15
00:00:26,540 --> 00:00:27,740
可他却病了
and he gets sick.

16
00:00:28,460 --> 00:00:30,760
我期待那场演唱会好几个月了
I'd been looking forward to that concert for months.

17
00:00:30,770 --> 00:00:33,317
这是我允许自己表现得像个同志的唯一一点
It's the one gay cliche I allow myself.

18
00:00:52,620 --> 00:00:53,840
别吵了
No more fighting!

19
00:00:54,080 --> 00:00:56,680
求求你们别再吵了
No more fighting for the rest of your lives,

20
00:00:56,720 --> 00:00:58,500
你们不许这样互吼
You are not allowed to yell at each other.

21
00:00:58,580 --> 00:01:00,860
-那你怎么就可以吼我们呢 -对 艾丽克斯 我可以
- But you're allowed to yell at us? - Yes, alex, I am,

22
00:01:00,880 --> 00:01:02,500
那是因为我给你做饭 给你们买衣服
Because I feed you and I clothe you

23
00:01:02,560 --> 00:01:03,480
连你们住的房子也是我来还房贷
And I pay the mortgage.

24
00:01:04,460 --> 00:01:07,800
看来你们老爹也机会一展狮吼绝技啊
Pretty sure old dad deserves a shout-out right about now.

25
00:01:07,880 --> 00:01:09,260
-菲尔 -抱歉
- Phil! - Sorry.

26
00:01:09,260 --> 00:01:11,140
没想到战况这么激烈
Should've taken the temperature of the room first.

27
00:01:11,140 --> 00:01:11,640
怎么了
What's up?

28
00:01:11,820 --> 00:01:14,440
卢克和曼尼 这两个小变态
Luke and Manny barged into our room

29
00:01:14,440 --> 00:01:15,880
在我们更衣时闯进我们的房间
While we were changing, the little pervs!

30
00:01:15,880 --> 00:01:18,780
我能插句话吗 在欧洲这可不算什么
Can I just say, in europe this would be no big deal.

31
00:01:19,000 --> 00:01:21,620
没错 你们可以随时看我穿内裤的样子
Yeah. You can see me in my underwear whenever you want.

32
00:01:21,780 --> 00:01:22,680
来 现在就给你们看
Here, I'll make it even.

33
00:01:22,680 --> 00:01:24,360
-卢克 别这样 -老妈 你看他
- No, hey, Luke, Luke, Luke! - Mom!

34
00:01:24,360 --> 00:01:26,640
卢克 别脱裤子
Luke, keep your pants on, okay?!

35
00:01:26,640 --> 00:01:28,426
女儿们 别什么事都这么歇斯底里
And, girls, stop getting so hysterical over everything!

36
00:01:28,426 --> 00:01:31,330
拜托 成熟点行不行
Come on! Now, grow up a little!

37
00:01:31,340 --> 00:01:33,060
我需要这里的风气稍微改改
I need things to start changing around here,

38
00:01:33,060 --> 00:01:34,800
不然我会强制你们改
Or I will change things, okay?

39
00:01:34,920 --> 00:01:37,520
禁止看电视 禁止上网
There will be no more TV and no internet

40
00:01:37,580 --> 00:01:39,120
还有禁止其他我能想到的事
And no whatever else I can think of.

41
00:01:39,120 --> 00:01:40,600
我能和你说几句吗 菲尔
May I have a word with you, Phil?

42
00:01:43,200 --> 00:01:44,160
能不说最好
I'd rather not.

43
00:01:45,920 --> 00:01:46,740
刚那算什么
What was that?

44
00:01:46,740 --> 00:01:49,660
-没什么 -你在我背后捅我一刀 菲尔
- Nothing. - Phil, you sold me out behind my back.

45
00:01:49,660 --> 00:01:52,180
哪有 只是觉得你有时太过严厉
No! It's just that sometimes you can get a little intense,

46
00:01:52,180 --> 00:01:53,380
我觉得我有必要小闹一下
And I feel like I need to swoop in

47
00:01:53,380 --> 00:01:54,840
让孩子们知道我们还是爱他们的
To let the kids know they're still loved.

48
00:01:55,000 --> 00:01:56,120
一脚踢飞你
I could kick you.

49
00:01:56,200 --> 00:01:58,240
亲爱的 为人父母都这样
Honey, these are just the parts that we're playing.

50
00:01:58,574 --> 00:02:00,100
我错了吗 这招能管用吗
Am I wrong, or has it been working?

51
00:02:00,100 --> 00:02:01,160
我感觉挺管用的
I feel like it's been working.

52
00:02:01,400 --> 00:02:03,300
我受够了总是当坏人
I'm tired of being the bad cop.

53
00:02:03,620 --> 00:02:04,980
有时需要你出面来管教下他们
You need to discipline them sometime

54
00:02:04,980 --> 00:02:07,200
等我这个好人来让他们感受被爱
And let me swoop in with all the love.

55
00:02:07,480 --> 00:02:09,080
难道咱们不应该坚守在自己擅长的岗位上吗
Shouldn't we just stick with the stuff we're good at?

56
00:02:09,180 --> 00:02:12,080
天啊 这卫生间太恶心了
Oh, my god! This bathroom is disgusting!

57
00:02:12,100 --> 00:02:14,100
女孩们几天前就答应我说会打扫的
The girls told me they would clean it days ago.

58
00:02:14,740 --> 00:02:16,660
我不能再对她们大吼大叫了 菲尔
I can't yell at them about it one more time, Phil.

59
00:02:17,100 --> 00:02:17,940
该你上了
You handle it.

60
00:02:18,060 --> 00:02:19,500
我也想 可我答应卢克和曼尼
I would, but I promised Luke and Manny

61
00:02:19,500 --> 00:02:21,320
要带他们去玩卡丁车 以此奖励他们的成绩
I'd take them go-karting for their good report cards.

62
00:02:21,320 --> 00:02:23,000
卢克的成绩哪里好了
What was good about Luke's report card?

63
00:02:23,820 --> 00:02:24,760
反正没有不及格
He didn't lose it.

64
00:02:25,460 --> 00:02:26,340
我带他们去
Let me take them.

65
00:02:26,640 --> 00:02:28,300
没错 让我去吧 你呆在家
Yes, let me take them. You stay here.

66
00:02:28,460 --> 00:02:29,880
敦促女孩们打扫卫生
Hound the girls about cleaning up this mess,

67
00:02:29,880 --> 00:02:32,080
而我会带卢克好好玩的
And I will take Luke to do something fun.

68
00:02:32,820 --> 00:02:33,220
可
But...

69
00:02:33,244 --> 00:02:34,780
我想玩卡丁车
I want to go go-karting.

70
00:02:34,780 --> 00:02:36,180
真可惜 我不知道该对你说什么
Yeah, I don't know what to tell you.

71
00:02:36,520 --> 00:02:37,320
可木已成舟
This is happening.

72
00:02:40,080 --> 00:02:40,480
男孩们
Boys!

73
00:02:41,413 --> 00:02:44,820
孩子们 猜猜谁今天带你们玩卡丁车
Hey, guys, guess who's taking you go-karting today.

74
00:02:44,820 --> 00:02:45,220
我
Me.

75
00:02:45,940 --> 00:02:46,340
为什么
Why?

76
00:02:46,860 --> 00:02:47,900
我们闯祸了吗
Are we in trouble?

77
00:02:47,900 --> 00:02:49,840
哪有 你们没有闯祸
No! You're not in trouble.

78
00:02:49,840 --> 00:02:51,800
今天我要带你们玩个够
Today's just all about having fun!

79
00:02:51,800 --> 00:02:54,220
告诉你们 卡丁车只是个开头
And you know what? Go-karting's just the beginning.

80
00:02:54,220 --> 00:02:55,000
我们还能玩什么
What else are we doing?

81
00:02:55,460 --> 00:02:56,540
玩什么都行
Whatever you want.

82
00:02:56,550 --> 00:02:59,140
-我想带上老爸 -估计悬 不能带
- I want to bring dad. - Well, tough. You can't.

83
00:02:59,140 --> 00:03:00,240
他有事要做
He's doing something else.

84
00:03:01,280 --> 00:03:03,300
各位再见 我们几个小时后回来
Goodbye. We will be back in a few hours.

85
00:03:03,300 --> 00:03:05,640
等等 你们要去哪
Oh, whoa! Where you guys going?

86
00:03:05,640 --> 00:03:07,400
我要带艾丽克斯去看电影
I am taking Alex to the movies,

87
00:03:07,400 --> 00:03:08,440
然后我再去趟购物中心
And then I'm going to the mall.

88
00:03:08,440 --> 00:03:11,813
听起来很有趣 是不 菲尔
How fun! That sounds like fun, doesn't it, Phil?

89
00:03:12,080 --> 00:03:14,380
我又不是个购物狂 可这取决于
I'm not much of a shopper, but it would depend on --

90
00:03:14,618 --> 00:03:16,452
打扫洗手间
Clean bathroom.

91
00:03:17,440 --> 00:03:17,840
女儿们
Girls...

92
00:03:17,840 --> 00:03:21,160
你们出门之前先打扫一下洗手间吧
How about you clean your bathroom before you go, huh?

93
00:03:21,160 --> 00:03:22,460
算帮你们老妈点忙
It'd really help your mom out.

94
00:03:22,460 --> 00:03:24,080
不用 我可没提这种要求
Oh, no. It's not about what mom wants.

95
00:03:24,080 --> 00:03:25,420
你们老妈无所谓
You mom is cool,

96
00:03:25,420 --> 00:03:26,900
对任何事都无所谓
Very cool with whatever.

97
00:03:27,340 --> 00:03:28,200
提这种要求的可是你们老爸
It's about what dad wants.

98
00:03:28,200 --> 00:03:29,938
老爸想去玩卡丁车
Dad wants to go go-karting.

99
00:03:32,100 --> 00:03:34,780
我非常希望你们能去打扫一下洗手间
I would really like it if you would clean your bathroom.

100
00:03:34,920 --> 00:03:35,580
那我的电影怎么办
But my movie!

101
00:03:35,580 --> 00:03:36,840
为什么非要现在做
Why do we have to do it now?

102
00:03:36,960 --> 00:03:38,900
因为克莱尔说了
Because Claire says so.

103
00:03:40,620 --> 00:03:42,240
因为我说了
Because I say so.

104
00:03:42,520 --> 00:03:44,240
还因为我是你们老爸
And because I'm your dad.

105
00:03:45,160 --> 00:03:46,760
我比你们年长
And I'm older than you,

106
00:03:47,620 --> 00:03:49,540
这儿我说了算
and I call the shots around here.

107
00:03:49,540 --> 00:03:50,900
-是吗 -对 是的
- Right? - Yes, you do.

108
00:03:51,080 --> 00:03:52,580
这太不公平了
This is so unfair!

109
00:03:53,040 --> 00:03:54,720
走吧 儿子 我们去玩玩
Come on, guys, let's go have some fun!

110
00:03:54,920 --> 00:03:56,960
-你把我拉疼了 -你没事的
- Ow! You're hurting me. - Oh, you're fine!

111
00:03:57,260 --> 00:03:57,840
玩的开心点 孩子们
Have fun, guys.

112
00:03:57,940 --> 00:03:59,220
走 走 走
Let's go! Let's go! Let's go!

113
00:04:03,360 --> 00:04:03,800
那
So...

114
00:04:03,800 --> 00:04:05,260
应该先从什么开始
How does this usually start?

115
00:04:10,741 --> 00:04:12,303
普里契特先生 早上好
Good morning, Mr. Pritchett.

116
00:04:12,680 --> 00:04:13,920
你好 你是斯波特吧
How you doing, Sport?

117
00:04:14,940 --> 00:04:16,820
我不知道那是谁 从来都不知道
I didn't know who that was. I never do.

118
00:04:17,080 --> 00:04:17,820
至少每月会有一天
At least once a month,

119
00:04:17,920 --> 00:04:19,720
我家厨房里会坐着一位陌生人
I find a total stranger sitting in my kitchen.

120
00:04:20,180 --> 00:04:21,920
歌洛莉亚收留各种流浪汉
Gloria collects every kind of stray

121
00:04:22,020 --> 00:04:23,420
求职的求财的 应有尽有
looking for work, money, you name it.

122
00:04:23,560 --> 00:04:24,640
她有一颗仁善之心
She's got a big heart.

123
00:04:25,740 --> 00:04:27,960
这是唯一我希望改变她的地方
It's the one thing I'd like to change about her.

124
00:04:30,920 --> 00:04:32,220
哇 狗狗 这个少见
Hey, a dog. That's new.

125
00:04:34,427 --> 00:04:35,961
那就是普里契特先生
That was Mr. Pritchett.

126
00:04:36,017 --> 00:04:38,000
杰 你来啦 过来
Oh, Jay, there you are. Come.

127
00:04:38,000 --> 00:04:39,600
我给你介绍一下吉尔莫
I want to introduce you to Guillermo.

128
00:04:39,700 --> 00:04:41,240
刚见过了 很谈得来
Just met him. Really hit it off.

129
00:04:41,240 --> 00:04:42,530
亲爱的 预算控制在100美元之内
Honey, keep it under a hundred bucks,

130
00:04:42,540 --> 00:04:43,440
根本连说都不必跟我说
you don't even have to tell me.

131
00:04:43,440 --> 00:04:44,500
-我要去打高尔夫了 -不行 等等
- I'm going golfing. - No.

132
00:04:45,240 --> 00:04:48,040
他人很好 在杂货店工作
He's a very nice man that works at the grocery store

133
00:04:48,040 --> 00:04:49,700
需要一些业务咨询
and needs a little bit of business advice.

134
00:04:49,800 --> 00:04:50,820
怎么早不说呢
Oh, why didn't you say so?

135
00:04:50,860 --> 00:04:51,800
我还以为他是住在
I thought he was just some nut

136
00:04:51,800 --> 00:04:53,340
干洗店的无赖呢
who lived behind the dry cleaner's.

137
00:04:53,340 --> 00:04:56,740
我们上个月帮他矫正鞋那家伙才是
Oh, that's the guy we bought corrective shoes for last month.

138
00:04:57,020 --> 00:04:59,340
杰 他知道你很成功
Jay, he knows how successful you are,

139
00:04:59,340 --> 00:05:02,852
他只是需要你给一小时 或半小时
And all he wants is an hour of your t-- half-hour.

140
00:05:02,903 --> 00:05:05,000
十分钟 我跟他保证过
10 minutes. I promise him!

141
00:05:05,000 --> 00:05:06,220
亲爱的 我爱你
Honey, I love you,

142
00:05:06,220 --> 00:05:08,100
但是你为什么拉我搀和进去呢
but why do you drag me into these things?

143
00:05:08,400 --> 00:05:10,320
你要学会拒绝别人
You've got to learn to say no to people.

144
00:05:10,380 --> 00:05:12,840
好 那你先问问我让不让你去打高尔夫
Fine. Ask me if you can go golfing now.

145
00:05:12,840 --> 00:05:13,960
是拒绝其他人
Other people.

146
00:05:14,460 --> 00:05:16,440
我想要的不过是 晚上睡觉时
All I want is, when I go to bed at night,

147
00:05:16,440 --> 00:05:19,960
身边躺着的是一个慷慨而乐施的男人
to be laying next to a man that is generous and giving.

148
00:05:19,960 --> 00:05:22,960
看来我要换个人躺了
And that man doesn't necessarily need to be you.

149
00:05:25,340 --> 00:05:26,280
行 那我们过去吧
Okay, let's do this.

150
00:05:26,480 --> 00:05:27,880
好的 吉尔莫
Okay. Guillermo!

151
00:05:30,401 --> 00:05:32,860
需要我把废纸篓放近一点吗
Do you want me to move the waste basket closer to you?

152
00:05:32,860 --> 00:05:34,980
-不用了 在哪儿都一样 -是吗
- Oh, no. It's fine where it is. - Really?

153
00:05:34,980 --> 00:05:37,115
但床看上去像花车游行的彩车
'cause the bed kind of looks like a rose parade float.

154
00:05:37,660 --> 00:05:39,260
谢谢你照顾我
Thank you for taking care of me.

155
00:05:39,400 --> 00:05:40,800
这是应该的
Well, what else would I be doing?

156
00:05:41,260 --> 00:05:43,360
当然还应该去看女神卡卡
Um, seeing lady gaga, that's what.

157
00:05:44,140 --> 00:05:46,340
小卡 我也不想现在就提这茬
So, uh, Cam, you know, I hate to bring this up,

158
00:05:46,340 --> 00:05:48,780
但是那演唱会怎么办
but what are we gonna do about that concert?

159
00:05:48,780 --> 00:05:49,360
什么意思
What do you mean?

160
00:05:49,540 --> 00:05:51,540
你知道的 我们都想去看
Well, you know, we were both looking forward to going.

161
00:05:51,820 --> 00:05:53,120
你想去看
You were looking forward to going.

162
00:05:53,480 --> 00:05:55,300
我是真的很想去看
I was really looking forward to going.

163
00:05:55,300 --> 00:05:58,880
而且 我不想眼睁睁看着门票浪费了
And I just -- I-I hate to see those tickets go to waste.

164
00:05:58,880 --> 00:05:59,680
我知道 我知道
I know, I know.

165
00:05:59,880 --> 00:06:01,100
那我们还有什么办法吗
But what are our options?

166
00:06:02,020 --> 00:06:03,660
我们可以一起去看演唱会
We could both go to the concert.

167
00:06:06,690 --> 00:06:08,408
还是算了吧
That's not gonna happen.

168
00:06:08,480 --> 00:06:10,800
我们可以到网上把票卖掉
Uh, well, we could sell the tickets online.

169
00:06:11,300 --> 00:06:13,320
不过一转手到网上就掉价了
But there's that craigslist killer.

170
00:06:14,380 --> 00:06:15,560
咋办呢 咋办呢
Oh, what to do? What to do?

171
00:06:15,580 --> 00:06:16,920
咋办呢 咋办呢
What to do? What to do? What to do?

172
00:06:16,920 --> 00:06:18,520
想办法 想办法
Other options, other options.

173
00:06:19,360 --> 00:06:20,880
米奇尔 你是在暗示
Mitchell, are you hinting

174
00:06:20,880 --> 00:06:22,500
你要丢下我独自去看演唱会
that you want to go to that concert without me?

175
00:06:23,020 --> 00:06:25,940
不 不 绝不可能
No! No! Not in a million years!

176
00:06:25,960 --> 00:06:28,600
但我很欣慰你主动提议
But that's very sweet of you to offer.

177
00:06:28,720 --> 00:06:30,340
-我没提议任何事 -真的吗
- I didn't offer.- Oh, really?

178
00:06:30,440 --> 00:06:31,980
感觉你就应该会说
'cause that just seems like something that you would say

179
00:06:32,080 --> 00:06:33,440
你去吧 我没事
"You go, I'll be fine.

180
00:06:33,440 --> 00:06:34,810
你为了买票倾尽所有
You spent all the money on the tickets,

181
00:06:34,810 --> 00:06:36,340
我会乖乖躺在床上等你回来的
And I'm just gonna lie in bed anyways."

182
00:06:36,340 --> 00:06:37,360
这才是小卡的作风
That's classic Cam.

183
00:06:37,360 --> 00:06:39,380
-我太虚弱了 -好吧 行
- I'm just so weak. - Okay, good.

184
00:06:39,440 --> 00:06:40,520
那就这样吧
You know what? It's settled.

185
00:06:40,520 --> 00:06:41,860
咱们就忘掉
We're just gonna put this whole

186
00:06:41,860 --> 00:06:43,600
"你坚持要我自己去看演唱会"
"You insisting I go to the concert without you"

187
00:06:43,600 --> 00:06:44,360
这回事吧
thing behind us.

188
00:06:45,840 --> 00:06:46,680
其实呢
You know what?

189
00:06:46,820 --> 00:06:47,160
其实什么
What?

190
00:06:49,120 --> 00:06:50,860
我能吃一小杯布丁吗
Can I get one of my little pudding cups?

191
00:06:51,440 --> 00:06:53,580
可以 当然可以拉
Yes, you can. Yes.

192
00:06:54,620 --> 00:06:55,600
你是欢乐地吃布丁
You eat the pudding,

193
00:06:55,620 --> 00:06:56,560
哥是含泪要吞票
and I'll eat the tickets.

194
00:07:00,995 --> 00:07:03,092
多谢您的款待 普里契特先生
Thanks for your dining, Mr.Pritchett.

195
00:07:03,092 --> 00:07:05,440
但等会你听过我的报告之后
But after you hearing my presentation,

196
00:07:05,440 --> 00:07:07,540
你就会反过来谢我了
you will be thanking me.

197
00:07:07,540 --> 00:07:09,600
你倒是很自信 这点我很欣赏
Well, you've got confidence. I admire that.

198
00:07:09,600 --> 00:07:10,900
他看好你哦 吉尔莫
He admires that, Guillermo.

199
00:07:11,020 --> 00:07:12,500
表现不错 再接再厉
You're doing great. Keep going.

200
00:07:12,800 --> 00:07:14,840
你是否知道 仅去年一年
Are you aware that last year,

201
00:07:15,020 --> 00:07:18,460
美国人就在驯犬上花费了四百亿美元
Americans spent $40 billion on dog training?

202
00:07:18,580 --> 00:07:19,500
压根没这回事
Well, that's not true.

203
00:07:19,560 --> 00:07:21,380
我和你一样 对此大跌眼镜
I was surprised as you are.

204
00:07:21,420 --> 00:07:23,360
你跌眼镜是因为压根没这回事
No, you were surprised because it's not true.

205
00:07:23,640 --> 00:07:25,820
嘘 接着说 吉尔莫
Shh! Go on, Guillermo.

206
00:07:25,820 --> 00:07:29,979
这个价值数十亿的产业 究竟缺失了什么呢
What is this multibillion-dollar industry missing?

207
00:07:29,979 --> 00:07:31,380
好一个"数十亿"
Multibillion dollars.

208
00:07:31,380 --> 00:07:34,460
我提出了一个革命性的人犬交互方案...
I have devised a revolutionary way to communicate --

209
00:07:34,460 --> 00:07:36,820
听着 我无意打断你的长篇大论
Listen, I hate to interrupt your big pitch,

210
00:07:36,840 --> 00:07:38,360
但是你的狗狗在啃我家抱枕
but your dog is chewing my pillow.

211
00:07:38,760 --> 00:07:39,680
太妙了
This is fantastic.

212
00:07:39,920 --> 00:07:41,440
对我家枕头来说 一点也不妙
It's not fantastic for my pillow.

213
00:07:41,440 --> 00:07:44,760
这是个供我展示"好狗狗坏狗狗"
It's a perfect opportunity for me to demonstrate

214
00:07:44,760 --> 00:07:47,460
驯犬系统的绝妙机会
the good doggie bad doggie training system.

215
00:07:47,472 --> 00:07:49,122
-我们一定入股 -等下 慢着
- We're in! - Wait, slow down.

216
00:07:49,122 --> 00:07:51,900
枕头的问题你打算怎么解决
What are we gonna do about the pillow situation?

217
00:07:51,900 --> 00:07:53,460
现在就是见证奇迹的时刻
Watch, and be amazed.

218
00:07:54,180 --> 00:07:55,740
斯黛拉现在不乖
Stella here is being a bad doggie.

219
00:07:56,250 --> 00:07:58,038
斯黛拉 松口 坏狗狗 坏狗狗
Stella, let go. Bad dog, bad dog.

220
00:07:58,480 --> 00:08:01,780
坏狗狗 坏狗狗会得到什么呢
Bad dog. And what does a bad dog get?

221
00:08:02,156 --> 00:08:04,116
一块坏狗狗奖励
A bad-doggie treat.

222
00:08:06,948 --> 00:08:07,720
等一下
Wait a minute.

223
00:08:07,720 --> 00:08:09,780
你是奖励她干坏事吗
You give her a treat for doing something bad?

224
00:08:09,780 --> 00:08:11,726
这是坏狗狗奖励
Ah, a bad-doggie treat.

225
00:08:11,726 --> 00:08:15,120
等她乖了 就能得到好狗狗奖励
When she is good, she gets the good-doggie treat.

226
00:08:15,120 --> 00:08:16,960
天才啊 我们要发啦
Brilliant! We're going to be rich!

227
00:08:17,120 --> 00:08:17,720
慢着慢着慢着
Whoa, whoa, whoa, whoa.

228
00:08:17,720 --> 00:08:20,383
这个坏狗狗好狗狗的奖励
What is the difference between a bad-doggie treat

229
00:08:20,392 --> 00:08:21,773
究竟有什么区别
and the good-doggie treat?

230
00:08:21,773 --> 00:08:25,540
都是培根 但坏狗狗奖励淡而无味
Bacon. The bad-doggie treat is very bland.

231
00:08:25,540 --> 00:08:27,060
我看她好像挺喜欢吃的
But she seems like she likes it.

232
00:08:27,060 --> 00:08:28,980
等看完好狗狗奖励再说吧
Wait till you see the good-doggie treat.

233
00:08:28,980 --> 00:08:30,340
斯黛拉 坐下
Stella, sit.

234
00:08:30,835 --> 00:08:33,189
现在是好狗狗奖励
Now a good-doggie treat.

235
00:08:36,264 --> 00:08:39,010
好吧 刚才坏狗狗奖励吃撑了
Okay, uh, she's still full from the bad-doggie treat.

236
00:08:39,020 --> 00:08:40,020
不过这就是
But there you have it --

237
00:08:40,100 --> 00:08:42,520
好狗狗坏狗狗驯犬系统
the good doggie bad doggie training system.

238
00:08:43,920 --> 00:08:46,020
欢迎来到发财之路的开端
Welcome to the ground floor.

239
00:08:46,120 --> 00:08:47,820
其实 你的狗正在我家地板尿尿呢
Actually, she's peeing on the ground floor.

240
00:08:47,830 --> 00:08:50,434
快点 快给她一块坏狗狗奖励
Quick, quick, give her a bad-doggie treat!

241
00:08:52,060 --> 00:08:52,540
喂
Hello?

242
00:08:52,800 --> 00:08:54,100
喂 是我 不方便接电话吗
Hey, it's me. Is this a bad time?

243
00:08:54,300 --> 00:08:55,380
没有 我在车里呢
No, I'm just in the car.

244
00:08:55,960 --> 00:08:57,360
好吧 我陷入了良知的挣扎
Okay, I'm having a moral dilemma.

245
00:08:57,360 --> 00:08:59,920
我们买了女神卡卡今晚演唱会的票 但是小卡病了
We have tickets for lady gaga tonight, but Cam's sick.

246
00:09:00,460 --> 00:09:01,080
那我去
I'll take them.

247
00:09:01,400 --> 00:09:02,720
但你根本不喜欢演唱会
Wait, you don't even like concerts.

248
00:09:02,920 --> 00:09:04,600
我喜欢 我现在是享乐派
Yes, I do. I'm fun now.

249
00:09:05,080 --> 00:09:07,020
克莱尔 他们说要满十三岁
Claire, they said we have to be at least 13

250
00:09:07,020 --> 00:09:08,080
才能开快车
to ride the fast ones.

251
00:09:08,320 --> 00:09:10,020
他们满十三了 没事的
They're 13. It's fine.

252
00:09:10,720 --> 00:09:12,320
这可把我整糊涂了
This is very confusing.

253
00:09:12,680 --> 00:09:14,420
上次去电影院时 她说我十一岁
At movie theaters, she says I'm 11.

254
00:09:14,960 --> 00:09:16,600
-咱能接着谈我的事吗 -什么
- Can we get back to me? - What?

255
00:09:17,100 --> 00:09:18,800
如果抛下他去看演唱会
Does it make me a horrible person

256
00:09:18,800 --> 00:09:20,060
我会不会显得很没人性啊
that I kind of want to go without him?

257
00:09:20,320 --> 00:09:21,480
他病得有多厉害
Well, how sick is he?

258
00:09:21,700 --> 00:09:22,740
不好说 就是病了
I don't know. He's sick.

259
00:09:22,980 --> 00:09:24,860
没到要帮他做回忆录的程度
You know, they're not gonna make a lifetime movie about him.

260
00:09:24,860 --> 00:09:26,852
那你生病的时候 他表现得怎样
Well, what's he like when you're sick?

261
00:09:27,560 --> 00:09:30,020
小卡 我自己能走到厨房
Cam, I think I can walk to the kitchen.

262
00:09:31,760 --> 00:09:32,560
表现还不错
He's okay.

263
00:09:33,020 --> 00:09:33,600
那你就去吧
You should go.

264
00:09:33,800 --> 00:09:34,680
知道我今天学到些什么吗
You know what I learned today?

265
00:09:35,100 --> 00:09:36,060
想要什么
You can't wait around

266
00:09:36,060 --> 00:09:37,460
不能干等着别人给你
for somebody to give you something you want.

267
00:09:37,940 --> 00:09:39,600
有时你要自己去争取
Sometimes you just have to take it.

268
00:09:39,611 --> 00:09:41,740
但我会很过意不去的
Oh, I'm gonna feel so guilty, though.

269
00:09:41,740 --> 00:09:42,920
如果你留下了 你会怨他的
You'll resent him if you stay.

270
00:09:42,920 --> 00:09:44,860
那这样好了 你呆在家
So, how about this -- you stay home

271
00:09:44,860 --> 00:09:47,040
照顾他 喂他喝汤 帮他足底按摩
and take care of him -- soup, foot rubs,

272
00:09:47,120 --> 00:09:48,740
-帮他擦鼻子 -好恶心
- you blow his nose. - Ew.

273
00:09:49,440 --> 00:09:50,540
有夫如此 他真是走运
He's so lucky to have you.

274
00:09:50,960 --> 00:09:52,580
就今晚在音乐会开始之前 你对他说
And then tonight, right before the concert, you say,

275
00:09:52,580 --> 00:09:55,100
"小卡 我爱你 但我真的很想去"
"Cam, I love you, but I really want to go."

276
00:09:55,100 --> 00:09:56,268
他会同意的
He'll say fine.

277
00:09:56,280 --> 00:09:58,580
你去时顺便把莉莉放我家 皆大欢喜
You drop Lily off at our house, and it's great.

278
00:09:58,640 --> 00:10:00,200
车手 启动引擎
Drivers, start your engines.

279
00:10:00,460 --> 00:10:01,280
我把扬声器打开
I'm putting you on speaker.

280
00:10:01,960 --> 00:10:02,580
你在做什么
What are you doing?

281
00:10:02,880 --> 00:10:04,840
让我的孩子们爱上我
Making my kids love me!

282
00:10:07,480 --> 00:10:11,020
车手 准备 三 二 一
Drivers, ready. Three, two, one!

283
00:10:13,391 --> 00:10:14,666
你出局啦 迪尔加多
You're going down, Delgado!

284
00:10:14,666 --> 00:10:17,058
尝尝这个
Like this!

285
00:10:27,220 --> 00:10:28,480
我们把厕所清理干净了
We're finished cleaning the bathroom.

286
00:10:28,560 --> 00:10:29,140
我们走啦
We're leaving.

287
00:10:29,360 --> 00:10:31,240
看吧 不会占用你们多长时间
See? That didn't take too long.

288
00:10:31,380 --> 00:10:32,360
谢谢 姑娘们
Thank you, girls.

289
00:10:32,360 --> 00:10:34,040
现在出去 好好玩 知道吗
Now, go and have a good time, all right?

290
00:10:34,040 --> 00:10:34,420
再见
Bye.

291
00:10:35,300 --> 00:10:37,360
看吧 你不需跟她们起冲突
See? You don't need all the conflict.

292
00:10:38,400 --> 00:10:41,080
提醒克莱尔 如果你想看激烈的家庭戏
Note to Claire -- if you want intense family drama,

293
00:10:41,300 --> 00:10:42,240
租部《非常小特务》
rent "Spy kids."

294
00:10:42,760 --> 00:10:44,120
他们挽救了父母的生命
They save their parents' lives.

295
00:10:44,120 --> 00:10:45,060
如果他们整天被父母嚷嚷
You think they would've done that

296
00:10:45,060 --> 00:10:46,440
你觉得他们还会这么做吗
if they got yelled at all the time?

297
00:10:58,100 --> 00:11:00,660
这俩小妞玩阴的
Sweet and sour chicken!

298
00:11:01,540 --> 00:11:02,060
姑娘们
Girls!

299
00:11:02,419 --> 00:11:05,389
回来 得把这楼梯修好
Get back h-- got to fix that step.

300
00:11:07,380 --> 00:11:07,900
姑娘们
Girls!

301
00:11:08,260 --> 00:11:09,080
他刚嚷咱们了
Did he just yell?

302
00:11:09,380 --> 00:11:10,720
-快开车 -我在开呢
- Drive! - I'm trying!

303
00:11:11,900 --> 00:11:13,680
你们给我马上回来
You girls get back here right now!

304
00:11:13,690 --> 00:11:14,441
假装你什么都没听到
Pretend you don't hear him.

305
00:11:14,441 --> 00:11:14,988
我知道你们听到了
I know you can hear me!

306
00:11:14,988 --> 00:11:16,452
天 他直接朝车奔来了
Oh, my god, he's heading straight for the car!

307
00:11:16,452 --> 00:11:18,590
天
Oh, my god! Aah!

308
00:11:18,600 --> 00:11:20,040
停车
Stop this car!

309
00:11:20,460 --> 00:11:22,560
-对不起 爸爸 -我们没听到
- We're sorry, dad! - We couldn't hear you!

310
00:11:22,560 --> 00:11:23,900
不许再撒谎
No more lies!

311
00:11:24,560 --> 00:11:26,080
姑娘们 你们惹到我了
You poked the bear, girls!

312
00:11:26,680 --> 00:11:27,700
这是你们自找的
You poked him!

313
00:11:28,700 --> 00:11:31,240
最后 真正的问题是
In closing, the only real question is,

314
00:11:31,250 --> 00:11:33,860
在你投资了好狗狗坏狗狗后
after you invest in good doggie bad doggie,

315
00:11:33,860 --> 00:11:35,440
我们怎么才能把所有的钱花完呢
How will we spend all our money?

316
00:11:35,660 --> 00:11:36,520
买手提包
In handbags!

317
00:11:36,920 --> 00:11:38,100
不 还是度假好
No, vacation!

318
00:11:38,560 --> 00:11:39,960
我知道了 家庭健身房
I know! A home gym!

319
00:11:39,960 --> 00:11:43,080
好的 吉列莫 你的野心具有传染性
All right, Guillermo, your ambition is infectious.

320
00:11:43,080 --> 00:11:45,360
显然我妻子需要接种疫苗
Clearly my wife needs to be inoculated.

321
00:11:45,600 --> 00:11:47,220
但我还是得坦率的说
But I'm gonna be blunt.

322
00:11:47,220 --> 00:11:49,160
-不不 你不会是要 -是的 没错
- Ay, no, no, you're not going to - Yes, I am.

323
00:11:49,180 --> 00:11:51,720
你想要听到诚实的商业建议 对吗
Now, you wanted my honest business advice, right?

324
00:11:51,720 --> 00:11:53,580
-非常想 -那你听着
- Very much. - Here it is.

325
00:11:54,620 --> 00:11:56,320
你的主意不咋的
Your idea is not good.

326
00:11:59,444 --> 00:12:00,836
不 杰是说
No, what Jay means is that when --

327
00:12:00,836 --> 00:12:02,129
不 我是说这主意太烂了
No, what I mean is it stinks.

328
00:12:02,140 --> 00:12:03,500
我不是针对你这个人
Now, that's nothing against you.

329
00:12:03,860 --> 00:12:04,860
你很帅气
You've got charm,

330
00:12:05,260 --> 00:12:06,800
你有野心 这很棒
you've got ambition, and that's great.

331
00:12:07,280 --> 00:12:09,480
你需要的只是一个更好主意
What you need is a better idea.

332
00:12:09,580 --> 00:12:11,060
但我没有更好的主意
But I don't have a better idea.

333
00:12:11,780 --> 00:12:13,480
任何想法都将会是个好主意
Any idea would be a better idea.

334
00:12:14,220 --> 00:12:15,800
你的话真如醍醐灌耳
Your honesty is refreshing.

335
00:12:17,220 --> 00:12:17,360
谢谢
Gracias.

336
00:12:17,360 --> 00:12:19,580
你把他弄哭了
Ay, you made him cry.

337
00:12:19,580 --> 00:12:20,280
他没哭
He's not crying.

338
00:12:20,280 --> 00:12:21,940
你不是在哭 是吧
You're not crying, are you?

339
00:12:22,360 --> 00:12:22,920
没
No.

340
00:12:23,820 --> 00:12:24,640
小泣而已
A little.

341
00:12:26,060 --> 00:12:29,160
我花费了五年 却一事无成
It's just five years of my life are for nothing.

342
00:12:29,300 --> 00:12:31,080
五 五年
Five? Five years?

343
00:12:31,860 --> 00:12:33,800
吉列莫 对不起
Ay, Guillermo, I'm sorry.

344
00:12:34,120 --> 00:12:36,100
不如你在这吃个中饭吧
Why don't you stay for lunch?

345
00:12:36,100 --> 00:12:38,982
我们可以为你的下个主意出谋划策
And -- and we can all brainstorm your next idea.

346
00:12:39,200 --> 00:12:41,540
真的吗 谢谢你 歌洛莉亚
Really? Thank you, Gloria.

347
00:12:42,400 --> 00:12:43,880
我去把斯黛拉放进车里
I go put Stella in the car.

348
00:12:43,880 --> 00:12:46,804
我不想她再破坏你家精美的东西
I don't want her ruining any more of your beautiful things.

349
00:12:47,520 --> 00:12:47,820
谢谢
Gracias.

350
00:12:48,906 --> 00:12:50,140
坏狗狗
Bad dog.

351
00:12:51,500 --> 00:12:53,060
你为什么要对他这么严厉
Why were you so tough with him?

352
00:12:53,220 --> 00:12:54,300
他很敏感的
He's very sensitive.

353
00:12:54,620 --> 00:12:55,720
你认为那是个好主意吗
Did you think that was a good idea?

354
00:12:55,800 --> 00:12:56,740
当然不是
Of course not!

355
00:12:56,940 --> 00:12:59,380
但是我是个好人 我会婉转地说
But I'm nice, and I put on the sugar jacket.

356
00:12:59,380 --> 00:13:01,680
婉转是帮不了他的
Sugar coating is not gonna help him.

357
00:13:01,680 --> 00:13:03,140
他需要听进去我对他说的
He needed to hear what I said to him,

358
00:13:03,140 --> 00:13:04,160
即使这话小小的刺伤了他
Even if it hurt a little bit.

359
00:13:04,160 --> 00:13:06,276
总有一天他会感谢我的
He's gonna thank me one day.

360
00:13:08,720 --> 00:13:11,140
吉列莫 现在我要道歉了
Ay! Guillermo! Now I have to apologize.

361
00:13:11,500 --> 00:13:11,900
我原谅你
Accepted.

362
00:13:12,020 --> 00:13:12,980
不是对你
Not to you!

363
00:13:21,252 --> 00:13:22,620
你想要什么 卢克
What are you gonna get, Luke?

364
00:13:22,620 --> 00:13:24,380
-我想要起司汉堡 -好的
- I want a cheeseburger. - Yeah!

365
00:13:24,640 --> 00:13:27,260
法式薯条和洋葱圈我不知道选哪个
And I can't decide between french fries or onion rings.

366
00:13:27,500 --> 00:13:28,320
那就都要了
Get them both!

367
00:13:28,440 --> 00:13:29,120
你呢 曼尼
How about you, Manny?

368
00:13:29,700 --> 00:13:32,100
你们有去皮的烤鸡胸肉吗
Um, do you have a skinless grilled chicken breast?

369
00:13:32,380 --> 00:13:33,700
不是吧 你是要参加舞会吗 灰姑娘
What, are you going to the ball, cinderella?

370
00:13:36,100 --> 00:13:38,060
我知道克莱尔在逗趣
I know Claire was trying to be fun,

371
00:13:38,120 --> 00:13:39,340
但那太过分了
but that crossed the line.

372
00:13:39,780 --> 00:13:41,540
还要别的吗 要奶昔吗
Anything else? Who wants a milkshake?

373
00:13:41,860 --> 00:13:43,140
要吗 要吗 来三份奶昔
Milkshake? Milkshake? Three milkshakes.

374
00:13:43,580 --> 00:13:45,120
我不想要奶昔
I didn't really want a milkshake.

375
00:13:45,400 --> 00:13:46,940
但听了她对曼尼说的话后
But after what she said to Manny,

376
00:13:46,940 --> 00:13:49,420
我决定明哲保身
I didn't want to risk it.

377
00:13:50,280 --> 00:13:51,360
妈妈 我不舒服
Mom, I don't feel good.

378
00:13:51,640 --> 00:13:52,780
你的奶昔喝完了吗
Did you finish your milkshake?

379
00:13:53,280 --> 00:13:54,620
我觉得就是奶昔害的
I think that was the problem.

380
00:13:54,780 --> 00:13:56,400
你以为你是医生啊
Look who's a doctor now.

381
00:13:56,760 --> 00:13:57,880
可能是派有问题
Maybe it was the pie.

382
00:13:58,060 --> 00:13:59,640
他没事的
Oh, he's fine. Hey.

383
00:13:59,980 --> 00:14:02,040
你们要玩过山车吗
Hey, who likes roller coasters?

384
00:14:03,260 --> 00:14:04,400
我需要一个袋子
I need a bag.

385
00:14:04,400 --> 00:14:06,440
卢克 你不会有事的
No. No, you're not gonna be sick, Luke.

386
00:14:06,440 --> 00:14:07,340
我们玩得正欢呢
We're having fun.

387
00:14:08,400 --> 00:14:08,880
好吧
Okay.

388
00:14:10,120 --> 00:14:11,560
不 我真得需要一个袋子
No, I really need a bag.

389
00:14:12,620 --> 00:14:13,560
把杯子的盖拿掉
Take the lid off the cup.

390
00:14:19,320 --> 00:14:20,280
我饿死了
I'm starving.

391
00:14:20,800 --> 00:14:23,080
我也一样 说些什么吧
Me too. Say something.

392
00:14:23,980 --> 00:14:26,720
爸爸 我们午饭还没吃呢
Um, dad? We haven't had lunch yet.

393
00:14:26,880 --> 00:14:28,140
非洲的孩子也没东西吃
Neither have half the kids in Africa.

394
00:14:28,140 --> 00:14:30,140
不要废话 继续干活
Stop yapping and get back to work.

395
00:14:31,633 --> 00:14:33,280
他干嘛把我们的笔记本用胶带封上
Why is he taping our laptops shut?

396
00:14:33,280 --> 00:14:34,660
因为他疯了
Because he's out of his mind.

397
00:14:34,720 --> 00:14:35,940
我没疯
I'm not out of my mind!

398
00:14:36,732 --> 00:14:39,849
你们耍赖那刻起 就失去了用电脑的权利
You took advantage,and you lost your computer privileges.

399
00:14:40,145 --> 00:14:42,195
爸爸 拜托 我们知道错了
Oh, come on, dad. We said we're sorry.

400
00:14:42,195 --> 00:14:44,900
而且我真不会疏通下水道
Plus I can't get the stupid drain unclogged, anyway.

401
00:14:44,900 --> 00:14:46,280
用挂钩伸下去
Stick that hanger down there.

402
00:14:46,280 --> 00:14:47,520
不
Ew, no!

403
00:14:47,780 --> 00:14:49,220
要么疏通下水道 要么你们剃光头
Well, it's either that or we cut off all your hair,

404
00:14:49,220 --> 00:14:51,171
因为你们的头发是元凶 怎么样啊
'cause that's what caused the problem -- thoughts?

405
00:14:51,480 --> 00:14:53,500
很好 清理完这个房间后
Good, because after you finish this room,

406
00:14:53,500 --> 00:14:54,990
你们去清理我的卫生间
you're gonna clean my bathroom, too,

407
00:14:55,000 --> 00:14:56,620
你们还可以知道我有多恶心
and you know how gross I can be.

408
00:14:56,620 --> 00:14:58,240
爸爸 不
Dad! No!

409
00:14:58,760 --> 00:14:59,900
天啊
Oh, my gosh.

410
00:15:00,420 --> 00:15:01,740
天啊
Oh, my gosh!

411
00:15:01,740 --> 00:15:03,826
-真恶心 -好了
- Ew! Gross! - All right.

412
00:15:05,042 --> 00:15:07,948
淡定 头发而已
Aah! Settle down. It's hair.

413
00:15:11,932 --> 00:15:12,940
天啊
Oh, my god.

414
00:15:12,940 --> 00:15:14,580
我不适合做这些
I'm not cut out for this.

415
00:15:14,580 --> 00:15:16,820
我一整天都在照顾小卡
I spent all day nursing Cam.

416
00:15:18,725 --> 00:15:20,180
可以换右脚了吗
Ohh. Hey, could you do the right one now?

417
00:15:20,180 --> 00:15:22,100
是一开始就按过的那只吗 当然可以
You mean the one we started with? Sure.

418
00:15:24,920 --> 00:15:27,420
我煮汤泡茶 做牛做马
I made soup. I made tea.

419
00:15:28,120 --> 00:15:30,180
终于 到了说真心话的关键时刻了
Finally, it was the moment of truth.

420
00:15:30,900 --> 00:15:32,580
小卡 我想
Cam, you know, I was thinking that...

421
00:15:43,380 --> 00:15:45,740
小卡 你可以不同意
Cam, you can say no,

422
00:15:45,980 --> 00:15:48,940
但我想去演唱会
but I was thinking about maybe going to that concert.

423
00:15:50,180 --> 00:15:52,880
谢谢 你最好了 我爱你
Thank you. You're the best. I love you.

424
00:16:00,500 --> 00:16:02,560
你回来了 你的朋友呢
Hey, you're back. What happened with your friend?

425
00:16:02,560 --> 00:16:04,760
他还好 你是对的
He's fine. You were right.

426
00:16:05,060 --> 00:16:06,900
他很欣赏你的真诚
He did appreciate your honesty.

427
00:16:06,980 --> 00:16:07,660
然后怎么样
How about that?

428
00:16:07,660 --> 00:16:10,520
他要改变他的生活
He's gonna make big changes to his life.

429
00:16:10,520 --> 00:16:10,800
很好
Good.

430
00:16:11,300 --> 00:16:12,500
他要回去上学
He's going back to school.

431
00:16:12,940 --> 00:16:15,980
那就意味着 他要和他姐一起住
That means he has to go back to live with his sister,

432
00:16:16,000 --> 00:16:18,460
那也意味着 他不能养狗
so that means that he had to get rid of the dog.

433
00:16:18,680 --> 00:16:21,180
他现在现实多了
But he's so much more realistic now.

434
00:16:21,180 --> 00:16:22,120
看到了吧
See that? Mm.

435
00:16:22,120 --> 00:16:24,140
顺便也给你上了一课
And there's a lesson in there for you, too,

436
00:16:24,320 --> 00:16:27,500
有时候拒绝会让事情会变得更好
'cause sometimes things go better when you just say no.

437
00:16:28,520 --> 00:16:30,700
不 你做了什么
No, no, no. What did you do?

438
00:16:30,700 --> 00:16:33,600
他要把它送到动物收留所
Ay! He was going to take her to the pound.

439
00:16:33,600 --> 00:16:34,440
那是他的事
But that's his business.

440
00:16:34,440 --> 00:16:37,240
-看看它的小脸 -不
- Ay, but look at her little face! - No.

441
00:16:37,240 --> 00:16:38,460
你根本不想要狗
You don't even want a dog.

442
00:16:38,560 --> 00:16:40,800
我知道 我在这方面有问题
I know. I have a problem.

443
00:16:41,732 --> 00:16:42,820
见鬼 曼尼回来了
Oh, crap, that's Manny.

444
00:16:42,820 --> 00:16:44,220
他如果看见这只狗 就完了
If he sees the dog, it's all over.

445
00:16:44,340 --> 00:16:45,140
我去锁门
I go lock the door.

446
00:16:45,220 --> 00:16:46,180
那可以解决问题吗
Oh, and that's the solution?

447
00:16:46,260 --> 00:16:48,760
在这狗老死之前 曼尼都在后院睡吗
Manny sleeps in the backyard till the dog dies of old age?

448
00:16:49,220 --> 00:16:50,720
我回来了
Hey, guys. I'm home.

449
00:16:51,180 --> 00:16:55,000
我觉得克莱尔遇到了一些事情
Boy, I think Claire's working through some stuff, because --

450
00:16:55,000 --> 00:16:55,620
天啊
Oh, my gosh!

451
00:16:55,680 --> 00:16:58,140
你们因为我的成绩 奖励我一只狗吗
You got me a dog because of my perfect report card?

452
00:16:58,140 --> 00:16:59,229
歌洛莉亚
Gloria?

453
00:17:00,200 --> 00:17:02,580
对不起 亲爱的 不是
Sorry, papi, no.

454
00:17:02,880 --> 00:17:04,680
这只狗要呆在另外一个地方
The dog lives somewhere else,

455
00:17:04,680 --> 00:17:06,180
现在就要送它过去
which is where she's going right now.

456
00:17:06,180 --> 00:17:08,174
-把地址发给我 -好吧
- Text me the address. - Okay.

457
00:17:08,760 --> 00:17:12,280
可以给我一点时间 跟她告别吗
Can I at least take a moment with her to tell her goodbye?

458
00:17:12,860 --> 00:17:14,340
跟她告别 你才见到她
Tell her goodbye? You just met her.

459
00:17:15,800 --> 00:17:17,300
对不起
I'm so sorry.

460
00:17:18,540 --> 00:17:20,980
卢克 宝贝 回来 对不起
Luke, honey, come back. I said I was sorry.

461
00:17:20,980 --> 00:17:23,080
我才十二岁 我需要被人管
I'm 12. I need limits!

462
00:17:23,080 --> 00:17:23,760
发生什么事了
What happened?

463
00:17:23,760 --> 00:17:25,820
我让他们把卡丁车开得太快了
Oh, I made them drive too fast

464
00:17:25,820 --> 00:17:26,780
还让他们吃得跟维京人[海盗]那么多
and eat like vikings,

465
00:17:27,000 --> 00:17:29,100
结果卢克吐得满车都是
and then Luke threw up all over the car.

466
00:17:29,254 --> 00:17:30,260
我得去清理一下
I got to go clean that up.

467
00:17:30,260 --> 00:17:32,240
不 不用你清 姑娘们
No, you don't. Girls!

468
00:17:32,780 --> 00:17:34,840
拿上你们的水桶 咱们车子那儿见
Grab your buckets and meet me by the car!

469
00:17:35,220 --> 00:17:36,300
不用她们干
They don't have to do that.

470
00:17:36,420 --> 00:17:37,540
我说了她们就得干
They do if I say so.

471
00:17:37,900 --> 00:17:38,700
真抱歉
I'm sorry.

472
00:17:38,700 --> 00:17:41,920
我刚说了拿上你们的水桶
I swear I just told you to grab your buckets!

473
00:17:42,280 --> 00:17:43,560
我们一整天都没吃东西了
We haven't eaten all day.

474
00:17:43,680 --> 00:17:44,480
我们饿了
We're hungry.

475
00:17:44,660 --> 00:17:45,820
你们马上就不饿了
Well, you won't be in a minute.

476
00:17:45,900 --> 00:17:47,420
亲爱的 你一整天都没让她们吃饭吗
Honey, you haven't fed them all day?

477
00:17:48,500 --> 00:17:50,540
她们就是怪兽 克莱尔
They're monsters, Claire --

478
00:17:51,560 --> 00:17:52,710
奸猾狡诈又善于耍心机的怪兽
Deceitful, manipulative monsters --

479
00:17:53,200 --> 00:17:54,920
我要让他们改邪归正
and they need to be broken.

480
00:17:55,280 --> 00:17:56,200
他疯了
He's crazy!

481
00:17:56,760 --> 00:17:58,680
你们知道吗 妈妈才是疯子
You know what?! Mom's the crazy one!

482
00:17:58,760 --> 00:18:00,060
她开卡丁车时从我手上碾过去了
She ran over my hand.

483
00:18:00,100 --> 00:18:01,260
我们当时玩儿的正高兴呢
We were having fun!

484
00:18:01,900 --> 00:18:02,820
姑娘们 到厨房去
Girls, go to the kitchen.

485
00:18:02,880 --> 00:18:03,460
找点东西吃
Get something to eat.

486
00:18:06,060 --> 00:18:07,740
菲尔 亲爱的 这是行不通的
Phil, honey, this isn't working.

487
00:18:07,840 --> 00:18:10,940
听我说 你不是当坏人的料
Listen to me,you are not a good bad cop,

488
00:18:10,940 --> 00:18:12,720
而且我当好人也当得很糟糕
and I am a very bad good cop.

489
00:18:12,720 --> 00:18:14,420
我们得各归其位 各司其职
We need things to go back to the way they were.

490
00:18:14,420 --> 00:18:15,692
-对 -没错
- Yeah. - Yeah.

491
00:18:15,980 --> 00:18:17,320
我都浑身发抖了
I feel really shaky.

492
00:18:18,880 --> 00:18:20,220
我不喜欢当"你"
I don't like being you.

493
00:18:23,180 --> 00:18:24,060
没人喜欢
Nobody does.

494
00:18:27,980 --> 00:18:28,860
要出门吗
Going somewhere?

495
00:18:28,860 --> 00:18:31,200
小卡 你起来了
Cam! You're up.

496
00:18:31,200 --> 00:18:32,560
你没料到这点 对吧
Didn't count on that, did you?

497
00:18:33,030 --> 00:18:34,860
你是要把莉莉放到你姐姐家去
Are you dropping lily off at your sister's,

498
00:18:34,860 --> 00:18:36,100
还是她帮我去听演唱会啊
or is she taking my ticket?

499
00:18:36,220 --> 00:18:38,400
好吧 首先 你怎么可能站在这儿
Okay, first of all, how are you standing?

500
00:18:38,480 --> 00:18:39,560
你喝的那些咳嗽糖浆
You drank enough of that cough syrup

501
00:18:39,560 --> 00:18:40,380
都足够放倒一只可怕的灰熊了
to put down a grizzly.

502
00:18:40,380 --> 00:18:42,020
让我来告诉你什么是可怕吧
I'll tell you what's grisly.

503
00:18:42,020 --> 00:18:43,260
你的行为
That is your behavior.

504
00:18:43,960 --> 00:18:46,780
幸亏我是现在就发现了
Well, it's just a good thing I'm finding out now,

505
00:18:46,900 --> 00:18:49,440
而不是我老病交加真正需要你的时候
instead of when I'm old and sick and really need you.

506
00:18:49,694 --> 00:18:53,880
我最好现在就开始给家庭健康计划存钱
Better start saving for some sort of home-healthcare plan,

507
00:18:53,880 --> 00:18:56,520
免得到时候我受伤的胯骨 或者持续性的肺炎
'cause I'd hate for my broken hip and subsequent pneumonia

508
00:18:56,520 --> 00:18:58,460
妨碍到你的夜生活
to interfere with your evening plans.

509
00:19:00,440 --> 00:19:02,280
小卡 不 你是对的
Okay, Cam, no, you're right.

510
00:19:02,360 --> 00:19:02,780
你是对的
You're right.

511
00:19:02,780 --> 00:19:05,680
我没什么好辩解的 我太糟糕了
I have no defense. I am terrible.

512
00:19:05,680 --> 00:19:07,060
而且关键在于 我知道这样很无耻
And the thing is,I knew I was terrible,

513
00:19:07,060 --> 00:19:08,340
可我还是去了
and I was going anyway.

514
00:19:08,800 --> 00:19:10,920
或许我曾试图劝说自己
I think maybe I tried to justify it

515
00:19:10,920 --> 00:19:12,520
咱们是不同类型的人
by saying we're two different people.

516
00:19:12,520 --> 00:19:13,640
你更像是一个无私的奉献者
And you're more of a caregiver,

517
00:19:13,640 --> 00:19:16,280
而我 则有其它的长处
and I have...other strengths.

518
00:19:16,280 --> 00:19:18,340
而这才让我们那么登对 知道吗
And that's what makes us such a good couple, you know?

519
00:19:18,340 --> 00:19:19,700
但是 不 不是的
But...No, no.

520
00:19:19,700 --> 00:19:21,060
这只是我用来逃避的借口
It's a cop-out.

521
00:19:21,060 --> 00:19:22,700
一直以来我都过分自私
And I've been very selfish,

522
00:19:22,800 --> 00:19:24,860
我需要有所长进 而我也一定会的
and I need to do better, and I will.

523
00:19:25,180 --> 00:19:27,300
我以莉莉的...
I swear on Lily's...

524
00:19:30,994 --> 00:19:32,021
...尿布袋起誓
...diaper bag.

525
00:19:41,960 --> 00:19:46,700
除了上去没别的选择了 对吧
Ah, no place to go but up, huh?

526
00:19:49,700 --> 00:19:51,320
别那么看着我
Don't look at me like that.

527
00:19:52,100 --> 00:19:53,280
家家有本难念的经
We all got problems.

528
00:19:56,480 --> 00:19:57,740
这招没用的 宝贝儿
This ain't gonna work, sweetie.

529
00:19:57,940 --> 00:20:00,320
你那楚楚可怜的眼神对我无效 来吧
That look ain't gonna work on me. Come on.

530
00:20:01,240 --> 00:20:02,660
来吧 咱们走
Come on. Let's go.

531
00:20:04,660 --> 00:20:07,820
我知道这很老套 不过我喜欢强势的男人
I know it's old-fashioned, but I like a strong man,

532
00:20:08,100 --> 00:20:10,240
一个可以替我说"不"的男人
a man that can say no when I can't.

533
00:20:19,240 --> 00:20:20,600
什么都别说
Not a word.

534
00:20:25,360 --> 00:20:26,660
不过取而代之的 我有杰
But instead, I have Jay.

535
00:20:27,920 --> 00:20:31,320
我很强势 不过你看看这张小脸
I'm strong. But look at this face.

536
00:20:33,180 --> 00:20:35,000
也许我们是因为身边的人
Maybe we are the way we are

537
00:20:35,000 --> 00:20:36,660
才成为现在的自己
because of the people we're with.

538
00:20:37,200 --> 00:20:39,740
又或许 我们只是挑中了我们需要的人
Or maybe we just pick the people we need.

539
00:20:39,740 --> 00:20:42,540
不管是怎样 当你们找到彼此
However it works, when you find each other,

540
